TEXT -640 -408 Left 5 ;This is a simulation for a whole energyday  with resolution 2h ( 0.1ms=2h ) of a hypothetic citynetwork with 1mio inhabitants\nThe simulation is for a whole loadline of loads and power plants ( for simplicity the four subnets are most the same )\nAlso the compensating devices and transformertaps can be altered \nsetting the optimal reacitve power compensation and voltage level.\nBy exchanging a line models with a ctrl model (or adding a switch) you can also simulate\nthe switchoff of a line at a specific simulation timepoint. You may also drag the line\nto a empty place of the schematic to set the line off for the whole simulation
